% ============================================================================
% igneous-rock-type-eruption-location.query — worked recall queries against
% igneous-rock-type-eruption-location.adj (adj-facts-stdlib, GEOLOGY).
% ============================================================================
% Three queries: forward recall (multiple answers) with citation, backward
% recall (bind a location, find the igneous type), and honest abstention on
% intrusive (this table only grounds the one igneous type whose cited span
% lists more than one eruption location).
% ============================================================================

import "igneous-rock-type-eruption-location.adj"

% Forward: what locations does the cited NPS sentence list for extrusive rock?
? igneous_rock_type_eruption_location(extrusive, $Location)

% Backward: which igneous type erupts into the atmosphere?
? igneous_rock_type_eruption_location($Type, atmosphere)

% Honest abstention: intrusive's cited span names only one location, no listed alternatives.
? igneous_rock_type_eruption_location(intrusive, $LocationIntrusive)
